[{"title":"旅馆书怀 其一","author":"李之世","text":"城市休相问，闭门事事疏。\n向人求药草，课仆种盆鱼。\n补壁悬新画，移床顿古书。\n閒庭刚洒扫，纤月到前除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆书怀 其二","author":"李之世","text":"恰似閒荒院，松门闭寂寥。\n催斋常过午，听雨每连朝。\n扫地延僧话，裁书谢客招。\n茆檐忻日出，向暖护兰苗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆书怀 其三","author":"李之世","text":"住处当官路，转过门巷斜。\n借经来静院，贷米向邻家。\n病眼长亲药，衰脾尚癖茶。\n偶逢方外士，劝我炼黄芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆书怀 其四","author":"李之世","text":"病来慵约束，舒散快心灵。\n客到频题字，童关渐解经。\n小池过雨碧，砌草闭门青。\n为惜春朝去，移花插胆瓶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆书怀 其五","author":"李之世","text":"铺设閒供具，常时净扫房。\n竹间安茗灶，花下置藜床。\n学演戏禽法，多传却老方。\n昼长无事事，小步绕巡廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠无树上人 其一","author":"李之世","text":"住山凡几腊，渡海忽经年。\n布衲冲云破，芒难踏岭穿。\n拈诗呈了义，不语悟单传。\n我亦同飘梗，茶香暂结缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠无树上人 其二","author":"李之世","text":"弥天江路迥，一锡向南飞。\n幻影原无住，逢山可当归。\n行随湘浦雁，身老粤中薇。\n相遇溪堂上，香云满衲衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小年夕同杨亦琳胡伯连对酌分赋明日立春","author":"李之世","text":"扁舟徒泛泛，野泊傍江渔。\n客况惊残腊，流年逼小除。\n消愁今夜酒，偿债几行书。\n独有乡园梦，先春到敝庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上萧拙修太史","author":"李之世","text":"秋杪离乡井，经春阻白门。\n风萍嗟浪迹，感激为酬恩。\n一顾时名重，千秋古谊存。\n尊前纡硕画，借箸向谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴彦先过访旅舍留宿","author":"李之世","text":"岭上一为别，那堪十载馀。\n难将心曲事，去觅往来书。\n以我伤萍梗，逢君问起居。\n相留惟脱粟，休叹食无鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访邱宗上人留宿","author":"李之世","text":"逢师寂无语，宴坐一炉香。\n空水摇山户，閒云宿石床。\n松因经腊古，草不待时芳。\n向晚檐鸦息，闻钟未下堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次同杨应先谭敬质玩月","author":"李之世","text":"乡心同此地，旅食算流年。\n几度天边月，虚从望里圆。\n凉风低烛影，清露湿茶烟。\n为爱连宵话，推篷未忍眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余自金陵与西粤文程可杨不群同舟屈指月馀念抵庾关行将告别临风对酒聊赠短章","author":"李之世","text":"孤棹自京华，迢迢水一涯。\n他乡同对酒，旅梦未还家。\n庾岭联归骑，淳江独泛槎。\n时危各努力，离索未应嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕前二日送李解一还鹿门","author":"李之世","text":"晏岁促归程，兰桡趁晓行。\n客心随候雁，乡梦记啼莺。\n冻雪融坭湿，残梅点袂轻。\n暂时还此别，相望隔年情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽甫家兄同容知微花下弹琴","author":"李之世","text":"幽人款竹扉，相对理清徽。\n夕霭下庭薄，轻风生袷衣。\n宛宛指间语，寥寥思际微。\n乍觉春寒重，流泉花外飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陈叔和过知微斋中听雨","author":"李之世","text":"云光与草色，清影碧参差。\n夜榻留灯处，閒窗听雨时。\n炉香飘茗盏，瓶露醒花枝。\n忽作沈沈溜，馀流迸入池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨柬何文起 其一","author":"李之世","text":"春愁不可奈，苦雨又连朝。\n架沁琴书湿，庭添几案潮。\n芳游能几许，索处更难销。\n为问花安否，相将护短条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨柬何文起 其二","author":"李之世","text":"雨湿燕坭重，花飞故傍帘。\n宿云痴欲堕，砌草嫩成淹。\n倦觉茶勋薄，寒欺酒力严。\n遥峰如可数，霁色露茆檐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过容知微园馆","author":"李之世","text":"庭皋望空阔，山霭晚烟微。\n犬护篱根静，蜂抟花粉归。\n暖风来燕雀，香露浥蔷薇。\n亦有中林客，乘閒款夕扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过羽甫家兄池馆留赠 其一","author":"李之世","text":"芳树接池阴，幽斋依小林。\n花标閒逸韵，松作淡虚音。\n过雨忙移药，拈香静谱琴。\n离居犹混俗，自是少尘心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过羽甫家兄池馆留赠 其二","author":"李之世","text":"深巷市喧隔，虚亭长寂寥。\n穿阶留绿笋，级树缀红椒。\n童子收松粉，山樵送药苗。\n诗筒兼酒盏，忙过百花朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈叔和馆","author":"李之世","text":"一区藏窈窕，片石斲云根。\n移树高于屋，编篱小作垣。\n云应供洒翰，鸟亦课閒言。\n不是琴诗侣，夜深谁打门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠容瑞瑜","author":"李之世","text":"名山终欲往，昏嫁暂随缘。\n候火调丹鼎，烹茶借蒳烟。\n閒心花石古，胜具木瓢坚。\n时有耽吟癖，孤峰顶上眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨怀知微","author":"李之世","text":"蛙吠水声急，陂塘春涨浮。\n草香微有韵，花淡却如秋。\n此际难成寐，思君独上楼。\n还听蕉叶里，疑入玉琴流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过放生社问高公先病","author":"李之世","text":"旅馆思难任。\n投閒依道林。\n青灯孤客梦，白社旧游心。\n斋钵分香积，閒阶狎施禽。\n毗耶虽示疾，一室散花深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨再柬羽甫兄并书所感","author":"李之世","text":"雨歇还复注，园庐恒暝阴。\n空阶行药遍，芳草闭门深。\n计口权留鹤，算囊欲卖琴。\n生涯随分过，不羡披裘金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽甫兄嘉荐侄过中林夜话","author":"李之世","text":"衡宇晚萧寂，客来破暝烟。\n灯影竹间出，屐声花外传。\n诗坛新旧局，世态雨晴天。\n与尔閒商略，悠悠夜似年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"李之世","text":"灯火隔篱落，溪桥人夜渔。\n树随波影动，萤傍草烟疏。\n螟阁报更后，官衙歇鼓初。\n此时惟静嘿，听雨掩残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过东皋访区茂对","author":"李之世","text":"竹院偕僧住，萧清长道心。\n花同禅味淡，草绕定坛深。\n斋阁听钟饭，閒廊接偈吟。\n书声萝屋里，和磬出疏林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋梅影 其一","author":"李之世","text":"半壁疑见画，虚廊月上时。\n轻霜含远韵，空水澹寒姿。\n祇自沈吟久，还堪折赠谁。\n绕檐凡几匝，宿鸟误投枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋梅影 其二","author":"李之世","text":"浮影浑无定，移梢渐过墙。\n月残微带晕，风细稍闻香。\n野寺斜桥外，孤村浅水旁。\n相看如旧识，伫立听更长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卢一清过访溪上","author":"李之世","text":"旧业在金阊，行踪遍五羊。\n游兼春草发，梦与海云长。\n新涨菰蒲岸，轻帆书画航。\n逢君今夕雨，疑是对潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得韩孟郁书知有仲弟之变寄此","author":"李之世","text":"得尔还家信，风霜知饱经。\n长途怜老马，归梦忆原鸰。\n客里囊先尽，愁边酒易酲。\n伤心池畔草，不似往年青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别卢一清次陈宪副韵","author":"李之世","text":"五月新潮涨，河堤处处通。\n远烟含岛碧，残照点帆红。\n把酒同听雨，停桡尚候风。\n萍踪聊复尔，休叹路西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸子赊月台玩月因怀知微","author":"李之世","text":"同舟嗟靡及，复此念离群。\n今夜高台月，随波流照君。\n空阶疑积水，花影乱苔文。\n目极江门树，依依隔暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将之五羊羽甫家兄携酒同诸子话别","author":"李之世","text":"相过频如此，相离暂亦难。\n兰尊初汎绿，荔浦正垂丹。\n孤月悬乡梦，清江破晓寒。\n幽怀不可写，明发路漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同卢一清黄逢永伍国开集陈集生太史斐园咏白鸭得轻字","author":"李之世","text":"澄沙照愈洁，汎汎雪衣明。\n带月宿无影，随波浮共轻。\n花阴时逐侣，浴罢自呼名。\n却谢朱阑斗，来游玉沼清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韩孟郁清居 其一","author":"李之世","text":"清幽谁得似，小筑仅如拳。\n树古藤交缀，篱疏竹任穿。\n室馀虚作白，亭有草成玄。\n转觉炎蒸薄，深林咽早蝉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韩孟郁清居 其二","author":"李之世","text":"山光纷入户，草色连青郊。\n揆地刚盈笏，穿池只一坳。\n纸窗萤借焰，阶树鸟同巢。\n且喜茆堂近，荆扉带月敲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴彦先还金陵兼讯冒伯麟林子邱林茂之洪仲韦诸子","author":"李之世","text":"轻装频往返，复此暂淹留。\n旅馆閒销夏，归期尚及秋。\n因君倾别泪，寄语问同游。\n目极无来雁，空江日夜流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中元节过长寿庵感怀","author":"李之世","text":"捣衣惊此月，乡梦起秋砧。\n况值盂兰节，谁无寸草心。\n金钱资佛曾，香钵趁禅林。\n复想家堂荐，遥遥泪满襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮仙籍为潘子仙题","author":"李之世","text":"恰有真仙骨，常参四百君。\n拾得丹灶药，私窥玉笈文。\n松影摇山月，天风吹海云。\n弄笛铁桥畔，羽衣凌紫氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张白一道人","author":"李之世","text":"颇学梅公隐，都忘尘市心。\n白云随杖远，红叶住山深。\n放鹤夜归洞，种桃春满林。\n祇应松下月，长照北堂阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁起先游飞来兼讯高斗仲朱惟四曾文卿","author":"李之世","text":"猿声啼不尽，霜叶点行舟。\n地有飞泉胜，山传古寺留。\n玄心寄独往，幻迹恣冥搜。\n倘遇清音侣，酣歌月满楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慰羽甫家兄失磬拈得四支韵","author":"李之世","text":"清斋閒寂寂，韵友亦何之。\n去住同为幻，声闻此暂离。\n转经残月后，对客罢谈时。\n翻觉无长物，沈冥或在兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"羽甫兄得还旧磬赋此志喜","author":"李之世","text":"孤磬忽云远，迢迢抱韵归。\n摩挲今再觌，清寂幸相依。\n灯影摇松月，窗光启曙晖。\n主人心似水，来去本忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送匡云上人归庐山","author":"李之世","text":"匡山禅诵处，三叠流泉飞。\n花雨飘空梵，晨钟滴翠微。\n一筇今独往，五岭送将归。\n休说还山好，孤云无是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日过访陈来献","author":"李之世","text":"林影乍回薄，清晖照槿园。\n花迎客共笑，春醉鸟无喧。\n挥麈参微论，呼童检韵言。\n玄心谁独赏，吾兴已腾鶱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周时府入计","author":"李之世","text":"夫子中朝彦，风流落下情。\n一琴流水远，双舄带星悬。\n马踏金门雪，花含玉露烟。\n怀芹何以献，天子在甘泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得秋荷","author":"李之世","text":"盆荷秋欲尽，偏放一枝奇。\n皎洁凌霜色，娉婷弄月姿。\n轻飔摇影动，香露泫珠垂。\n向夕钩帘坐，应添静夜思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送容九闳游韶阳","author":"李之世","text":"对酒不能别，相看泪欲挥。\n河梁一分手，前路换春衣。\n柳色经霜嫩，梨花带雨飞。\n倘逢山水胜，休令赏心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄讯曲江梁国桢","author":"李之世","text":"君才真扩落，空自带南冠。\n梁狱珠光暗，丰城斗气寒。\n黄金散欲尽，白眼醉相看。\n勿讶虞罗窄，鸿飞厉羽翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鬼灯笼","author":"李之世","text":"质与凡根植，名因俗谚传。\n绿幕看疑掩，丹心寂不然。\n似带青燐色，微含宿草烟。\n无心随佛日，故傍法轮悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别邓黄二生","author":"李之世","text":"一尊临水曲，露白蒹葭秋。\n扬舲不可住，之子去悠悠。\n蝉声在乔木，雁影度江楼。\n含情各分手，离思满芳洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27080,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭峨昆过访话别","author":"李之世","text":"北风入庭户，萧索揽貂裘。\n以我栖迟志，逢君不榻留。\n江枫黄叶渡，烟舸白蘋洲。\n明发凤城去，茫茫不可求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27081,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"李之世","text":"妾命真成薄，君恩未是疏。\n玉楼闻玉漏，金殿度金舆。\n长乐歌钟歇，长门夜月虚。\n愁颜无复少，传语谢相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27082,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"巫山高","author":"李之世","text":"云雨暮仍朝。\n阳台入望遥。\n时时横翠馆，往往堕金翘。\n乍拂霞裾动，还承羽盖飘。\n凄凉千古梦，无语对空寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27083,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爱妾换马","author":"李之世","text":"祇分辞新宠，宁知念敝帷。\n妆台封玉镜，仙苑登金羁。\n孤泪双双落，长蹄宛宛垂。\n若为丽姬怨，端谢塞公悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27084,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明月光","author":"李之世","text":"明月一何光，閒愁偏共长。\n可怜千里目，犹滞两江乡。\n朔雁冲残雪，寒砧拂夜霜。\n倚栏空袖手，挥泪湿流黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27085,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远别离","author":"李之世","text":"生长深闺里，何曾解别离。\n可怜今日去，况值春风时。\n弱柳维行舫，鸣莺恋旧枝。\n长亭千万里，相送日迟迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27086,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新婚别","author":"李之世","text":"由来生别苦，不似新婚时。\n踏月频惊影，临妆懒画眉。\n带自同心结，琴调绝命词。\n愁心看鸿雁，无字寄相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27087,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将别息庐夜坐志感","author":"李之世","text":"群喧归一寂，人鸟亦交冥。\n暗牖能来月，澄池可数星。\n难将今夜意，去问草堂灵。\n飒飒疏槐下，风吹几叶青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27088,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"装简","author":"李之世","text":"一囊空复尔，客计若为欢。\n久矣谋生浅，于今出户难。\n疏交谁可托，冷面竟羞干。\n且置休相问，回灯语夜阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27089,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"李之世","text":"微尚将无隔，兴居百念回。\n口和心自语，形与影相猜。\n圣世谁甘隐，逢时谅不才。\n中宵缘底事，起步独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27090,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社中琴集送吴生还金陵余亦将北上","author":"李之世","text":"别绪人方嘿，离弦泛泛长。\n君应携韵去，余亦束琴装。\n荷渚擎云翠，枫窗点叶黄。\n泉声弥恋恋，似惜马蹄忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27091,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游飞来寺题振衣亭","author":"李之世","text":"凉风生两腋，步步陟危亭。\n石似兼泉坠，云疑恋壑停。\n虚光涵远白，零露沁空青。\n几度忙游此，难招帝子灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27092,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白下投赠李伯开","author":"李之世","text":"浮踪何所住，曾否赋归来。\n珠海逢君处，兰桡此际开。\n残霜犹酿橘，新雪欲衔梅。\n今夜澄江上，离怀向月裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27093,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次螺江始闻萧伯玉大行奉使还里不及造访怅然有寄","author":"李之世","text":"千里劳书问，经途窅不闻。\n谁云衣带水，能隔往来云。\n清月犹悬梦，皇华独照君。\n倚桡频欲寄，沙雁怅离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27094,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秉烛赠所欢","author":"李之世","text":"萧膏和蜡炬，送喜入欢房。\n敛泪当明镜，扬葩助艳妆。\n轻摇翠羽幕，半浸象牙床。\n好把冰罗护，留欢待玉郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27095,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]